     "text": [
      "Comb lines available : 64\n",
      "Symbol slots         : 4096\n",
      "seed 0: Bob SER = 0/4096   |  Eve(line 15): detected 78 slots (true data 78), decoded 71/78 wrong\n",
      "seed 1: Bob SER = 0/4096   |  Eve(line 15): detected 78 slots (true data 78), decoded 73/78 wrong\n",
      "seed 2: Bob SER = 0/4096   |  Eve(line 15): detected 78 slots (true data 78), decoded 71/78 wrong\n",
      "seed 3: Bob SER = 0/4096   |  Eve(line 15): detected 78 slots (true data 78), decoded 72/78 wrong\n",
      "seed 4: Bob SER = 0/4096   |  Eve(line 15): detected 78 slots (true data 78), decoded 72/78 wrong\n",
      "TOTAL 5 seeds: Bob errors = 0/20480 -> SER = 0.00e+00\n",
      "Eve sees only ~1.9% of the payload on one tapped line (~1/64), and decodes essentially all of it wrong (no keys).\n"
     ]
    },
